    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Josia wa Juda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josia orekoghe mundu wa irika ja miaka wunyanya iji orezoyagha kubonya nguma; ukabonya nguma Jerusalemu miaka mirongo idadu na ghumweri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer. 3.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukabonya mecha imbiri ya BWANA, ukanugha seji ndee Daudi orebonyereghe, hata ndereghalukieghe nambai andu kungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Josia kunona wutasi ghwa milimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka ghwa wunyanya ghwa kubonya nguma kwake, orezoeghe kumlola Mlungu wa ndee Daudi uko mwana wokoni; na mwaka ghwa ikumi na iwi, ukazoya kuielesha Juda na Jerusalemu kwa kuinja andu kotasira mighondinyi, na fwana ra mlungu ghwa waka Ashera, na fwana rewacha na rechana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukafunya momu madhabahu ra weke Baali rivuchulo, na madhabahu refukiria marumba rerekoghe naighu yaro rikainjwa, na fwana ra Ashera na fwana riwachilo na iro richanilo, rikabarwa na kusheghwa hata rikawuya teri; nayo ikadilwa aighu ya makaburi gha awo wandu werekoghe wikirifunyira vizongona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Waz. 21.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mal. 33.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni wikaghikora maindi gha wakohani wawo aighu ya madhabahu raro; Josia ukailesha Juda na Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Waz. 13.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na andenyi ya maghacho gha mizi ya Manase, Efraimu, na Simeoni hata kuvika mbai mbai ya Naftali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "orerivuchueghe madhabahu, ukabara fwana ra Ashera na kurisha hata rikawuya teri; ukarikua nambai madhabahu refukiria marumba andenyi ya isanga jose ja Israeli. Niko ukawuya Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chuo cha Sharia kuwoneka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka ghwa ikumi na wunyanya ghwa kubonya nguma kwa Mzuri Josia, nyuma ya kujielesha isanga na Hekalu, ukaduma Shafani mwana wa Azalia, na Maaseia, m'baa wa muzi, na Joa mwana wa Joahazi, karani, wiendeboisa Hekalu ya BWANA Mlungu wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikacha kwa Mkohani M'baa Hilkia, wikamneka pesa rerekoghe raredwa Hekalunyi ni Walawi, awo walindiri mnyango, iro wereriwusireghe kufuma kwa wandu wa Manase, na Efraimu, na wandu wa Israeli wose weresigharikieghe, na wandu wose wa Juda na Benjamini, na awo wose werekoghe wikikaia Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko rikanekwa awo wandu weredumiloghe kuzighana Hekalu, nawo wikawilipa waja wandu wereboisagha Hekalu na kuibonya wuwishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni wikarineka mafundi gha mbau, na gheagha magho wighuo naro kokoto na mbau refunga na kubonya trasi ra maaghi agho gheresighiloghe ni wazuri wa Juda ghikanoneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo wandu werebonyagha kazi werekoghe waloli nandighi; wikizighanirwa ni Jahathi na Obadia, Walawi wa kivalwa cha Merari, na Zekaria, na Meshulamu wa kivalwa cha Kohathi. Walawi wose werekoghe mafundi ghekaba vombo vebora, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "werekoghe wazighaniri wa wandu weduka misigo; wikakaia wikiwiwonyera wandu wose werekoghe wikibonya kazi iro rose; na Walawi wamu werekoghe walimu wa Sharia, na wabaa wa kazi, na walindiri mbenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji werekoghe wikifunya pesa kufuma Hekalunyi, mkohani Hilkia ukawona chuo cha Sharia iyo BWANA oremnekieghe Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Hilkia ukamzera muandiki Shafani, “Nawona chuo cha Sharia Hekalunyi;” ukamneka Shafani icho chuo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shafani ukamredia mzuri icho chuo ukighamba, “Kazi yose koredinekieghe isi wadumiki wako yaawuyabonywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dafunyire pesa rose rerewikiloghe Hekalunyi, dikarineka wanyapara na wabonyi kazi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko mwandiki Shafani ukamzera mzuri, “Neko na chuo nanekwa ni Mkohani Hilkia.” Shafani ukachishoma imbiri ya mzuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri uendasikira malagho gha Sharia, ukarashua nguwo rake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko mzuri ukafunya momu kwa Hilkia, Ahikamu mwana wa Shafani, Abdoni mwana wa Mika, muandiki Shafani, na mdumiki wa mzuri Asaia ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghendenyi mkotie malagho kwa BWANA kwa wundu ghwapo, na kwa wundu ghwa wandu wisigharikie andenyi ya Israeli na andenyi ya Juda aighu ya malagho gha icho chuo chawonwa, angu BWANA oko na machu mabaa nandighi aighu yedu kwa kukaia weke aba wiseghiwadie malagho gha BWANA na kughibonya na seji ghiandikilo andenyi ya icho chuo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Hilkia na wambao weredumiloghe ni mzuri, wikaghenda kwa mlodi wa waka Hulda, muka wa Shalumu mwana wa Tohathi wawae Hasra uo orekoghe ukilindia marwao gha Hekalunyi. (Nao orekoghe ukikaia Jerusalemu Mtaa ghwa Kawi;) wikamja agho malagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawizera, “BWANA uo Mlungu wa Israeli waghora huwu, ‘Mzerenyi uo mundu umdumie kwapo kukaia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ini BWANA nichareda mawiwi Jerusalemu, na kuwikaba wandu waro kwa njowe rose riandikilo andenyi ya chuo chishomelo imbiri ya mzuri wa Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia wanisighie na kuifukiria milungu mizima marumba, hata wikanibonya nijoko ni machu kwa iro kazi wiribonyere; nichakaba Jerusalemu kwa machu mabaa ghisehoagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mzuri wa Juda uhu umdumie mchenikotia malagho mumzere kukaia ini BWANA, Mlungu wa Israeli naghora welee, Agho malagho kwaghisikira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghikakubonya kuhee na kukusera imbiri yapo kwendasikira kukaia nichakaba andu aha na wandu waro, kukakusera imbiri yapo, kukarashua nguwo rako na kulila, ini wori nakusikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ola nichakubonya kufo sa weke ndeyo, na kuwikwa kaburinyi kwa sere, na oho ndekuchaawona wuwiwi nichaaghureda andu aha, na kwa wandu waro anduangi.’” Niko wikammbunjira mzuri malagho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Josia kubonya ilaghano je msikira BWANA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko mzuri ukawiwanga chiaimweri waghosi wose wa Juda na Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukajoka Hekalunyi chiaimweri na wandu wose wa Juda, na awo wikaiagha Jerusalemu, na wakohani, na Walawi, wandu wose wabaa na watini; ukawishomia malagho gha icho chuo cha ilaghano cherekoghe chawonwa andenyi Hekalunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukakaia kimusi andu kwake, ukabonya ilaghano imbiri ya BWANA kukaia, uchabonya seji BWANA ukunde, na kuwadia malaghiro ghake, na memu yake, na sharia rake, kwa ngolo yake yose, na kwa roho yake yose, kukatisha malagho gha ijo ilaghano seji ghiandikilo andenyi ya icho chuo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ukawibonya wandu wose wa Jerusalemu na Benjamini werekoghe aho wimaziriane najo. Na wandu wikaiagha Jerusalemu wikabonya karakara na ilaghano ja Mlungu uo Mlungu wa weke ndee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josia ukainja wuchafu ghose ghwa milimu ghorekoghe andenyi ya isanga jose jerekoghe ja Israeli; ukawibonya wandu wose werekoghe andenyi ya Israeli wimdumikie BWANA Mlungu wawo. Ndeweresighieghe kumnugha Mlungu wa weke ndee matuku ghose gha Mzuri Josia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
